# Store text as LF in the repository and check it out as LF everywhere.
#
# This is authored on Windows and builds on Linux (Cloudflare Pages). Without
# this, Git's autocrlf would rewrite line endings on checkout and a later diff
# could show every line of a file as changed when nothing in it actually was.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
